# Akai, Panda Warrior

> Akai is a tank for teams that can kill one displaced target fast. He is not the safest generic roamer in a blind lobby. Pick him when the map gives you walls, your damage can follow the pin, and the enemy carry cannot reset the fight before Heavy Spin finishes.

